  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [instantsearch.js](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/) ([source](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js)) | dependencies | minor | [`3.5.4` -> `3.6.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/instantsearch.js/3.5.4/3.6.0) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>algolia/instantsearch.js</summary>\n\n### [`v3.6.0`](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;360httpsgithubcomalgoliainstantsearchjscomparev354v360-2019-07-30)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/compare/v3.5.4...v3.6.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **clearRefinements:** reset page to 0 ([#&#8203;3936](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3936)) ([7378a0a](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/7378a0a))\n-   pass noop as default value to unmountFn at connectors ([#&#8203;3955](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3955)) ([7c38744](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/7c38744))\n-   **enhanceConfiguration:** deduplicate the hierarchicalFacets ([#&#8203;3966](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3966)) ([baf8a35](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/baf8a35))\n-   **hierarchicalFacets:** prevent different rootPath on same attribute ([#&#8203;3965](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3965)) ([5ee79fa](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/5ee79fa))\n-   **menuSelect:** unmount component ([#&#8203;3911](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3911)) ([f6debce](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/f6debce))\n-   **rangeInput:** unmount component ([#&#8203;3910](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3910)) ([f6c29e8](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/f6c29e8))\n-   **refinementList:** fix showMore button to work after search ([#&#8203;3082](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3082)) ([23e46b6](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/23e46b6))\n\n#### [3.5.4](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/compare/v3.5.3...v3.5.4) (2019-07-01)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **connectSortBy:** do not throw with wrong indexes ([#&#8203;3824](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3824)) ([2a84ee2](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/2a84ee2))\n-   **deps:** update dependency instantsearch.js to v3.5.3 ([#&#8203;3877](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3877)) ([463f3bb](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/463f3bb))\n-   **escape:** make sure that \\_\\_escaped does not get removed ([#&#8203;3830](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3830)) ([fbafd22](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/fbafd22))\n-   **getRefinements:** check for facet before accessing its data ([#&#8203;3842](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3842)) ([aadc769](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/aadc769))\n-   **panel:** return value from dispose ([#&#8203;3895](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3895)) ([bceb78f](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/bceb78f))\n-   **voiceSearch:** remove event listeners on stop ([#&#8203;3845](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3845)) ([688e36a](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/688e36a))\n\n#### [3.5.3](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/compare/v3.5.1...v3.5.3) (2019-05-28)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **voiceSearch:** let the connector handle the default value of searchAsYouSpeak when it's not given ([#&#8203;3817](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3817)) ([9d3e91b](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/9d3e91b))\n-   **getTag:** use object version of toString ([#&#8203;3820](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3820)) ([a7348ea](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/a7348ea))\n-   **types:** fix cssClasses of voiceSearch ([#&#8203;3783](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3783)) ([f016326](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/f016326))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
